        <activityName xml:lang="en">Multi-Si wafer, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Multi-Si wafer, at regional storage
Shares of production in APAC (73%) and import from China (27%).;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, cadmium telluride, thin film; 
UUID: dce7839a-ec45-4fc1-b3f7-c487e72acedf
Domestic production and imports of multi-crystalline silicon wafers used in photovoltaic cell production in Asia and Pacific. Transport from different world regions to regional storage.
Location: Regional supply mix calculated based on data for the worldwide production and consumption.
Technology: None
Time period: Data refer to 2018
Production volume: na
Sampling: Survey among market intelligence companies 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_dce7839a-ec45-4fc1-b3f7-c487e72acedf.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
